06) If están en "The Sleeper Has Awakened", luego lead Kerlonian Evershade /target sur into Ashenvale.  Keep aggro off de Kerlonian Evershade as he can die easily.  As work tu way sur, there will be several tough spawns along el main path that can be avoided by staying away desdel main path by en least 20 yards.  I recommend traveling just off el main path starting en 27.25, luego work tu way sur a través del wilderness a avoid el tough spawns.  Luego entra en hut en Maestra's Post y entrega "The Sleeper Has Awakened" 27.36, if fail again, luego skip it.
 ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[56] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
