 ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[63] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) justo al este de alrededor de Sundown Marsh (starting en 18.27, luego work este) do "Apprentice's Duties": mata y saquea a Giant Wetlands Crocolisks /target.  There está only 13 spawns NW en Wetlands.  If run out de enemigos do el next few steps luego come back a this area a completa it.
02) You can stop en 26.26 a get repaired/resupplied.  NOTE:  At this small camp, can have another chance a purchase a Gyrochronatom y a Bronze Tube desdel NPC there (if haven't yet elsewhere), these están usad para later misiones.  If did, can store them en mailbox by sending them a tu ALT (next time ve a town) y return them back a.
03) N/A
