05) ve al este en Ironforge y entrega (Draenei may have already turned this en) "An Old Colleague" 72.52, y if have 4 Minor Mana Potions y 2 Elixir de Minor Fortitude con, acepta y entrega "Ineptitude + Chemicals = Fun", SKIP el next part.
