06) At Ironforge, ve al bank 35.61 y get el following items out:  Stack de 10 Turtle Meat, tu stack de Elixir de Water Breathing potions y any Swim Speed Potions  may have.  Put en tu bank:  Kravel's Parts y Fuel Regulator Blueprints.
07) GET NEW ABILITIES, 07) Get new spells/abilities en Ironforge.
